<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi"><head><%- include('partials/head') %><title>Admin Panel · Krishi Rakshak</title></head>
<body><header><%- include('partials/navbar') %></header><div class="layout"><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><main class="main-content page-content"><div class="admin-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">ADMIN CONTROL CENTER</p><h1>Namaste, <span><%= user.name %></span></h1><p>Government schemes और app content को एक जगह से manage करें।</p></div><a href="/schemes" class="btn btn-light">User view देखें</a></div><section class="admin-stats"><div><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i><small>Registered farmers</small><strong><%= userCount %></strong></div><div><i class="fa-solid fa-landmark"></i><small>Active schemes</small><strong><%= schemes.length %></strong></div><div><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i><small>Access level</small><strong>Admin</strong></div></section><section class="admin-grid"><div class="admin-form-wrap"><h2><%= editing ? 'Scheme अपडेट करें' : 'नई Scheme जोड़ें' %></h2><p>यह बदलाव किसानों को तुरंत दिखाई देगा।</p><form class="admin-form" method="post" action="<%= editing ? '/admin/schemes/' + editing.id : '/admin/schemes' %>"><label>Scheme title<input name="title" required value="<%= editing?.title || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. PM-KISAN"></label><label>State / coverage<input name="state" value="<%= editing?.state || 'All India' %>"></label><label>मुख्य लाभ<input name="benefit" value="<%= editing?.benefit || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. ₹6,000 प्रति वर्ष"></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" required rows="4" placeholder="किसान को यह योजना कैसे मदद करेगी?"><%= editing?.description || '' %></textarea></label><label>Official link<input name="link" type="url" value="<%= editing?.link || '' %>" placeholder="https://..."></label><button class="btn btn-success" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> <%= editing ? 'Changes save करें' : 'Scheme publish करें' %></button><% if (editing) { %><a href="/admin" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Cancel</a><% } %></form></div><div class="admin-list"><h2>Published schemes</h2><% schemes.forEach(scheme => { %><article><div><span><%= scheme.state %></span><h3><%= scheme.title %></h3><p><%= scheme.benefit %></p></div><div class="row-actions"><a href="/admin/schemes/<%= scheme.id %>/edit" title="Edit"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i></a><form method="post" action="/admin/schemes/<%= scheme.id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('क्या इस scheme को हटाना है?')"><button title="Delete"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button></form></div></article><% }) %></div></section></main></div></body></html>


